    <h2 class="published-by-lead">
      Published in <a class='link' href='https://afm.journal.fi/issue/view/10342'>Vol. 1 No. 2 (1975)</a> of <a class='link' href='https://afm.journal.fi/index'>Annales Fennici Mathematici</a>.
    </h2>
          <div class="html-text" tabindex="-1">
        <p>Annales Fennici Mathematici publishes original research papers in all fields of mathematics. One volume, divided into two issues, is published annually. The publisher of the journal is the Finnish Mathematical Society.</p>
